@using Economy.Domain.Entites.TenantEntity.EntityAppContents
@using Economy.Domain.Entites.TenantEntity.EntityAppLanguages
@using Economy.Panel.UI.Areas.Tenant.Models.AppPageViewModels
@model PageEditVm
@{
    var langs = (List<AppLanguage>)ViewBag.Languages;
    ViewBag.Title = Model.Id == null ? "New Page" : $"Edit Page #{Model.Id}";
}

<main>
    <div class="container-fluid">
        @await Html.PartialAsync("_breadcrumbs")

        <h3>@ViewBag.Title</h3>

        <form asp-action="Edit" method="post">
            @Html.AntiForgeryToken()

            <div class="card mb-3">
                <div class="card-body row g-3">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <label class="form-label">Slug</label>
                        <input class="form-control" asp-for="Slug" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <label class="form-label">Stage</label>
                        <select class="form-select" asp-for="Stage">
                            <option value="0">Draft</option>
                            <option value="1">Published</option>
                            <option value="2">Archived</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-2 d-flex align-items-center">
                        <div class="form-check mt-4">
                            <input class="form-check-input" asp-for="IsActive" />
                            <label class="form-check-label">Active</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h5>Translations</h5>
            <div class="row g-3">
                @for (int i = 0; i < Model.Translations.Count; i++)
                {
                    var lid = Model.Translations[i].LanguageId;
                    var lang = langs.First(x => x.Id == lid);
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card-header">
                                <strong>@lang.Name (@lang.Code.ToUpper())</strong>
                                <input type="hidden" asp-for="Translations[i].Id" />
                                <input type="hidden" asp-for="Translations[i].LanguageId" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <label class="form-label">Title</label>
                                <input class="form-control mb-2" asp-for="Translations[i].Title" />
                                <label class="form-label">SEO Title</label>
                                <input class="form-control mb-2" asp-for="Translations[i].SeoTitle" />
                                <label class="form-label">SEO Description</label>
                                <textarea class="form-control" asp-for="Translations[i].SeoDescription" rows="2"></textarea>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mt-4">
                <h5>Blocks</h5>
                <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <select id="newBlockType" class="form-select form-select-sm" style="width:220px">
                        <option value="">Block type…</option>
                        @foreach (var t in Enum.GetValues(typeof(BlockType)))
                        {
                            <option value="@((int)t)">@t</option>
                        }
                    </select>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" type="button" id="btnAddNew">Add Block</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="grid" class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-xl-3 g-3 mt-1">
                @for (int i = 0; i < Model.Blocks.Count; i++)
                {
                    <partial name="_BlockCard" for="Blocks[i]" />
                }
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save</button>
                <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Pages", new { area = "Tenant" })">Back</a>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</main>
@section Scripts {
    <script>
        const langs = @Html.Raw(System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Serialize(((List<AppLanguage>)ViewBag.Languages).Select(l => l.Id)));
        document.getElementById('btnAddNew').addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
          const type = document.getElementById('newBlockType').value;
          if(!type) return;
          const idx = document.querySelectorAll('#grid .block-card').length;
          const url = '@Url.Action("BlockCardPartial", "Pages", new { area = "Tenant" })' + `?type=${type}&index=${idx}` + langs.map(l=>`&languageIds=${l}`).join('');
          const resp = await fetch(url); const html = await resp.text();
          document.getElementById('grid').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', html);
          normalizeOrders();
        });

        // Drag&drop
        let dragging;
        document.addEventListener('dragstart', e => { const c=e.target.closest('.block-card'); if(!c) return; dragging=c; c.classList.add('dragging');});
        document.addEventListener('dragend', e => { if(!dragging) return; dragging.classList.remove('dragging'); dragging=null; normalizeOrders();});
        document.addEventListener('dragover', e => {
          e.preventDefault();
          const container=document.getElementById('grid');
          const after=getAfter(container,e.clientY);
          if(!dragging) return;
          if(after==null) container.appendChild(dragging); else container.insertBefore(dragging,after);
        });
        function getAfter(container,y){
          const els=[...container.querySelectorAll('.block-card:not(.dragging)')];
          return els.reduce((c,el)=>{const box=el.getBoundingClientRect();const off=y-box.top-box.height/2;return (off<0&&off>c.offset)?{offset:off,element:el}:c;},{offset:Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY}).element;
        }
        function normalizeOrders(){
          document.querySelectorAll('#grid .block-card').forEach((el,idx)=>{ const input=el.querySelector('input[name$=".SortOrder"]'); if(input) input.value=idx; });
        }
    </script>
}
